      "long_copy": "You spend hours choosing the softest onesies and the coziest blankets, but what about the one thing your baby wears 24/7? Introducing CloudSnug Diapers. Designed with a revolutionary cloud-plush lining and a 360-degree adaptive stretch waistband, our diapers move with your baby, preventing leaks and eliminating chafing. Give your little one the gift of uninterrupted sleep and joyful play. Tap the link to get 20% off your first CloudSnug box!"
    },
    "social_media_assets": {
      "instagram_caption": "Fussy moments? Not on our watch! ☁️👶 Keep your little one smiling from naptime to playtime with the ultimate comfort of CloudSnug Diapers. No red marks, no leaks, just pure softness. Tap the link in our bio to claim your free trial pack! ✨ #CloudSnugBaby #HappyBaby #MomLife",
      "twitter_post": "Tired of diaper chafing and leaks? Upgrade your baby's comfort with CloudSnug Diapers. 100% breathable, ultra-soft, and baby-approved. 🍼☁️ Shop now! [Link]",
      "suggested_hashtags": [
        "#CloudSnug",
        "#BabyComfort",
        "#ParentingHacks",
        "#MomLife",
        "#DadLife",
        "#HappyBaby",
        "#GentleCare"
      ]
    },
    "video_ad_script": {
      "scene_1": {
        "visual": "Close up of a baby sleeping peacefully on a soft white blanket. Golden hour lighting.",
        "audio": "Soft, soothing acoustic guitar plays."
      },
      "scene_2": {
        "visual": "Baby wakes up smiling and starts crawling energetically. Camera zooms in on the CloudSnug diaper stretching and moving perfectly with the baby's movements.",
        "audio": "Voiceover: 'When they are truly comfortable, the whole world becomes their playground.'"
      },
      "scene_3": {
        "visual": "Parent picks up the baby, spinning them around and snuggling them. Graphic overlays appear: 'Ultra-Soft', 'Breathable', 'Hypoallergenic'.",
        "audio": "Voiceover: 'Wrap them in the comfort they deserve with CloudSnug Diapers.'"
      },
      "scene_4": {
        "visual": "Product shot of the diaper box with a '20% OFF' badge. A button graphic reads 'Try Now'.",
        "audio": "Voiceover: 'Click the link to try CloudSnug risk-free today and get 20% off your first order.'"
      }
    },
    "call_to_action": "Shop Now and Get 20% Off Your First Order!"
  }
}

